WEBVTT

NOTE verify-results: written VO text from episode.json, timed from the timeline VO placements

V0-1
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:05.168
A push is four phases, not one.

V0-2
00:00:05.268 --> 00:00:09.480
Knowing them tells you what
a slow run is waiting for.

V1a-1
00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:18.887
Nothing is read before the push begins.
Stations are written in sequence with

V1a-2
00:00:18.987 --> 00:00:23.660
a short pause between each, and the
progress line names which one it is on.

V1b-1
00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:28.738
The writing counter runs on a fixed timer
and does not wait for Lynx. If a run

V1b-2
00:00:28.838 --> 00:00:33.643
stalls, it stalls in the next phase, while
Spatial Adjust waits for Lynx to answer.

V2a-1
00:00:40.427 --> 00:00:41.541
With the writing done,

V2a-2
00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:45.037
Spatial Adjust retrieves the current
percent adjustments from Lynx.

V2b-1
00:00:45.593 --> 00:00:50.608
This is a read-back, not a baseline. It is
collecting what Lynx actually holds now,

V2b-2
00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:54.213
so the next phase has something
to check the push against.

V3a-1
00:01:00.307 --> 00:01:03.575
Spatial Adjust re-reads the
station list and compares

V3a-2
00:01:03.675 --> 00:01:06.697
each value it sent against
what Lynx now reports.

V3b-1
00:01:07.207 --> 00:01:11.787
Anything that does not match is treated
as failed rather than assumed good.

V4a-1
00:01:18.590 --> 00:01:22.889
Stations that did not take are
re-pushed, up to two further attempts

V4a-2
00:01:22.989 --> 00:01:27.288
after the first. The progress line
names how many are being retried,

V4a-3
00:01:27.388 --> 00:01:30.360
so a retry is information
rather than an error.

V4b-1
00:01:30.873 --> 00:01:35.794
The bar restarts at zero for the retry
pass and counts only the failed stations.

V4b-2
00:01:35.894 --> 00:01:40.015
A drop from nearly complete back
to nothing is the retry beginning,

V4b-3
00:01:40.115 --> 00:01:41.593
not the push collapsing.

V5a-1
00:01:47.637 --> 00:01:51.707
A clean run confirms that every selected
change reached Lynx and verified.

V5b-1
00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:55.060
The dialog reports success
rather than a failure count.
